$$

#### Constraints

1. Overall Capacity Constraint:
   $$
   \sum_{i \in I} w_i \cdot x_i \leq C
   $$

2. Non-negativity:
   $$
   x_i \geq 0 \quad \forall i \in I
   $$

---

